      "summaries": {
        "en": "Career-Ops is an AI-powered job search system that automates resume tailoring, cover letter generation, and interview preparation using Claude Code. Its key technical insight is the use of 14 specialized skill modes, each leveraging distinct prompts and context to optimize outputs for different roles. Built with a Go dashboard for batch processing and PDF generation, it streamlines the entire job application workflow. You can clone the repo, configure your API keys, and run it via CLI to process multiple applications at once, saving hours of manual effort.",
        "zh": "Career-Ops 是一个基于 Claude Code 的 AI 求职系统，旨在自动化简历定制、求职信生成和面试准备。其核心技术亮点是 14 种技能模式，每种模式通过不同的提示词和上下文优化输出，精准匹配不同岗位需求。系统采用 Go 语言构建仪表盘，支持批量处理和 PDF 生成，大幅提升求职效率。你可以克隆仓库，配置 API 密钥后通过命令行运行，一次性处理多个职位申请，将数小时的手动工作缩短至几分钟。无论是针对特定公司定制简历，还是批量投递，这个工具都能显著减轻求职负担。",
        "es": "Career-Ops is an AI-powered job search system that automates resume tailoring, cover letter generation, and interview preparation using Claude Code. Its key technical insight is the use of 14 specialized skill modes, each leveraging distinct prompts and context to optimize outputs for different roles. Built with a Go dashboard for batch processing and PDF generation, it streamlines the entire job application workflow. You can clone the repo, configure your API keys, and run it via CLI to process multiple applications at once, saving hours of manual effort.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "career-ops stands out for ai-agent, anthropic, and automation in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Career-Ops is an AI-powered job search system that automates resume tailoring, cover letter generation, and interview preparation using Claude Code. Its key technical insight is the use of 14 specialized skill modes, each leveraging distinct prompts and context to optimize outputs for different roles. Built with a Go dashboard for batch processing and PDF generation, it streamlines the entire job application workflow. You can clone the repo, configure your API keys, and run it via CLI to process multiple applications at once, saving hours of manual effort.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/santifer/career-ops for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
