      "summaries": {
        "en": "NGINX is a high-performance web server, reverse proxy, and load balancer designed to handle massive concurrent connections with minimal resource usage. Its event-driven, asynchronous architecture avoids thread-per-connection overhead, making it ideal for high-traffic sites. Use it to serve static content, terminate SSL, cache responses, or distribute traffic across backend servers. Extend functionality via modules for caching, security, or HTTP/3 support.",
        "zh": "NGINX是一款高性能Web服务器、反向代理和负载均衡器，采用事件驱动的异步架构，避免多线程开销，资源消耗极低，可轻松支撑数万并发连接。它适用于托管静态网站、终结SSL加密、缓存响应内容及分发请求至后端集群。通过丰富的模块系统（如缓存、安全、HTTP/3支持），能灵活适应高流量电商网站、微服务网关等场景，显著提升服务效率。",
        "es": "NGINX is a high-performance web server, reverse proxy, and load balancer designed to handle massive concurrent connections with minimal resource usage. Its event-driven, asynchronous architecture avoids thread-per-connection overhead, making it ideal for high-traffic sites. Use it to serve static content, terminate SSL, cache responses, or distribute traffic across backend servers. Extend functionality via modules for caching, security, or HTTP/3 support.",
