        "zh": "Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Instruct 是一个专为代码任务优化的140亿参数指令微调模型。它擅长代码生成、调试和解释，在开源代码模型中达到顶尖水平。技术上，它通过监督微调和基于人类反馈的强化学习来精准对齐用户意图。你可以用它编写函数、跨语言翻译代码或生成单元测试。得益于适中的参数量，它适合通过Ollama或vLLM等工具本地部署，在保证性能的同时降低硬件门槛。",
        "es": "Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Instruct is a 14-billion-parameter code-focused language model fine-tuned for instruction following. It excels at code generation, debugging, and explanation, achieving state-of-the-art performance among open-source code models. Technically, it uses advanced training techniques like supervised fine-tuning and reinforcement learning from human feedback to align with user intent. You can use it for tasks like writing functions, translating code between languages, or generating unit tests. Its compact size makes it suitable for local deployment with tools like Ollama or vLLM.",
